---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout noindex
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy Policy for Best Shanghai Restaurants. Learn how we collect, use, and protect your data, the cookies we set, and your choices when browsing our site."
>
  <main>
    <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-20 md:pt-28 pb-24">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl tracking-tighter leading-none font-semibold text-slate-900">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <div class="mt-10 space-y-6 text-slate-500 leading-relaxed text-sm">
          <p>Last updated: July 2026</p>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Information We Collect</h2>
          <p>We collect anonymous usage data through Google Analytics to understand how visitors use our site. This includes pages visited, time on site, and referring sources. We do not collect personal information unless you voluntarily provide it when you email us.</p>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Cookies</h2>
          <p>We use essential cookies for site functionality and analytics cookies to improve our content. You can disable cookies in your browser settings at any time.</p>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Third-Party Services</h2>
          <p>We use Google Analytics for traffic analysis. Google's privacy policy governs how they handle collected data.</p>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Contact</h2>
          <p>For privacy-related inquiries, contact us at privacy@shanghai-restaurant.com.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
